      "content": "# Updated AddMemberDialog Component\n\nBased on your request to use the users list for the selector, here's the refactored component:\n\n```vue src/components/teams/AddMemberDialog.vue\n<script setup>\nimport MemberAvatar from './MemberAvatar.vue'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 p-2 w-80\">\n    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-plus text-primary\"></i>\n      Add Member\n    </h3>\n\n    <div class=\"form-control gap-1\">\n      <label class=\"label label-text text-xs font-semibold\">User *</label>\n      <select\n        v-model=\"form.userId\"\n        class=\"select select-bordered select-sm\"\n        @change=\"onUserSelected\"\n        ref=\"userSelect\"\n      >\n        <option value=\"\">Select a user...</option>\n        <option\n          v-for=\"user in availableUsers\"\n          :key=\"user.id\"\n          :value=\"user.id\"\n        >\n          {{ user.username }}\n        </option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"form-control gap-1\">\n      <label class=\"label label-text text-xs font-semibold\">Role</label>\n      <select class=\"select select-bordered select-sm\" v-model=\"form.role\">\n        <option value=\"admin\">\ud83d\udc51 Admin</option>\n        <option value=\"moderator\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Moderator</option>\n        <option value=\"member\">\ud83d\udc64 Member</option>\n        <option value=\"guest\">\ud83d\udd0d Guest</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Preview -->\n    <div v-if=\"selectedUser\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-base-200 rounded-xl\">\n      <MemberAvatar :member=\"previewMember\" size=\"sm\" :show-status=\"false\" />\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">{{ selectedUser.username }}</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs text-base-content/50 capitalize\">{{ form.role }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex gap-2 justify-end\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"$emit('close')\">Cancel</button>\n      <button\n        class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n        :disabled=\"!form.userId\"\n        @click=\"submit\"\n      >\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-plus\"></i>\n        Add Member\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  name: 'AddMemberDialog',\n  emits: ['added', 'close'],\n  props: {\n    team: { type: Object, required: true }\n  },\n  data() {\n    return {\n      form: {\n        userId: '',\n        role: 'member'\n      },\n      selectedUser: null\n    }\n  },\n  mounted() {\n    this.$nextTick(() => this.$refs.userSelect?.focus())\n  },\n  computed: {\n    availableUsers() {\n      const allUsers = this.$storex.users.allUsers || []\n      const existingMemberIds = (this.team.members || []).map(m => m.id)\n      return allUsers.filter(u => !existingMemberIds.includes(u.id))\n    },\n    previewMember() {\n      if (!this.selectedUser) return null\n      return {\n        id: this.selectedUser.id,\n        username: this.selectedUser.username,\n        role: this.form.role,\n        status: 'online'\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    onUserSelected() {\n      this.selectedUser = this.availableUsers.find(u => u.id === this.form.userId) || null\n    },\n    submit() {\n      if (!this.form.userId || !this.selectedUser) return\n      const member = this.$storex.teams.addMember({\n        teamId: this.team.id,\n        memberData: {\n          id: this.selectedUser.id,\n          username: this.selectedUser.username,\n          role: this.form.role,\n          status: 'offline'\n        }\n      })\n      this.$emit('added', member)\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n## Key Changes:\n\n1. **User Selection**: Changed from text input to a dropdown `<select>` that displays available users\n2. **Available Users**: Filters users from `this.$storex.users.allUsers` and excludes those already in the team\n3. **User Selection Handler**: `onUserSelected()` method updates the selected user when dropdown changes\n4. **Preview Member**: Uses selected user data for the preview component\n5. **Form Validation**: Button is disabled until a user is selected\n6. **User ID Storage**: Now stores and sends `userId` instead of `username`\n\nThis component now integrates with your users store and prevents duplicate members from being added to a team.",
